---
---
<section class="section-migration" id="migration">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="migration-wrapper">
      
      <div class="migration-text">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          O trecere controlată
        </span>
        <h2 class="migration-title">
          URL-urile existente și dependențele tehnice sunt planificate cu atenție.
        </h2>
        <p class="migration-desc">
          Dacă se modifică structura, conținutul sau tehnologia, migrarea este planificată de la început.
        </p>
        <p class="migration-disclaimer">
          Aceste măsuri reduc riscurile tehnice cunoscute. Nu pot fi garantate poziții în motoarele de căutare, volume de trafic sau rezultate comerciale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="migration-tech-box">
        <div class="tech-box-header">
          <div class="tech-dot dot-r"></div>
          <div class="tech-dot dot-y"></div>
          <div class="tech-dot dot-g"></div>
          <span class="tech-box-title">migration-plan.sh</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="tech-checklist">
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            identificarea URL-urilor și conținuturilor relevante;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            asocierea logică a paginilor vechi cu cele noi;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            planificarea și verificarea redirecționărilor 301;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            controlul legăturilor interne, titlurilor, etichetelor canonice și indexării;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            verificarea sitemap-ului, codurilor de stare, găzduirii, domeniului și accesurilor;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            utilizarea datelor existente din Analytics sau Search Console când sunt relevante;
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tech-check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
              <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
            </svg>
            testarea conținuturilor, funcțiilor și afișării înainte de lansare.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-migration {
    padding: 7rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-page);
  }

  .migration-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .migration-text {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .migration-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .migration-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .migration-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border-light);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .migration-tech-box {
    background: #0f172a;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
  }

  .tech-box-header {
    background: #1e293b;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
  }

  .tech-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .dot-r { background: #ef4444; }
  .dot-y { background: #f59e0b; }
  .dot-g { background: #10b981; }

  .tech-box-title {
    margin-left: 1rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .tech-checklist {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tech-checklist li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .tech-check-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    color: #34d399;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .migration-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .migration-text {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
